# step 3: answer. The web inlet renders the envelope minus `_`-keys, so
# the flags from scope 200 are already in the body. Add the list we
# matched against and a config object — both from files, both keeping
# their JSON types (an object stays an object, null stays null) — and halt.
WHEN @web.req.url.path == "/check"
  EMIT .statuses = $[../_data/statuses.json],
       .config = $[../_data/config.json],
       @web.res.status = 200,
       @halt = true
